1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:06,423
Part 17 mein chemists se payment collection: cash, UPI, NEFT aur cheque,

2
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:13,041
partial aur full payment, bill-wise adjustment, receipt, collection history,

3
00:00:13,041 --> 00:00:14,957
aur cheques ka hisaab.

4
00:00:15,917 --> 00:00:18,414
Finance mein Collections kholiye.

5
00:00:18,414 --> 00:00:24,696
Record a payment form mein chemist list ke saath har chemist ka due bhi dikhta hai,

6
00:00:24,696 --> 00:00:28,177
taaki galat chemist mein paisa na chala jaaye.

7
00:00:28,854 --> 00:00:35,547
Pehla example: Doranda Drug House ne NEFT se 20,000 rupaye bheje.

8
00:00:35,547 --> 00:00:43,063
Chemist chuniye, amount, mode Bank transfer NEFT, aur bank ka UTR number.

9
00:00:43,063 --> 00:00:44,402
Post receipt.

10
00:00:45,082 --> 00:00:47,210
Receipt voucher ban gaya.

11
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:52,998
Yeh payment sabse purane bill ke against pehle lagta hai, yani FIFO.

12
00:00:52,998 --> 00:01:00,318
Isse ageing hamesha sahi rehti hai, aur chemist ka purana bill hi pehle band hota hai.

13
00:01:00,999 --> 00:01:05,584
Doosra example: Morabadi Medicine Centre ne cheque diya.

14
00:01:05,584 --> 00:01:09,841
Mode Cheque, cheque number, bank aur cheque ki date.

15
00:01:09,841 --> 00:01:17,291
Cheque turant bank mein nahi jaata: woh Cheques in hand mein rehta hai jab tak clear na ho.

16
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:22,775
Yeh partial payment hai: Morabadi par is se zyada baaki tha,

17
00:01:22,775 --> 00:01:26,146
toh balance ghat gaya par khatam nahi hua.

18
00:01:26,146 --> 00:01:33,369
Agar koi due se zyada rakam daale, toh Medoro rok deta hai: amount exceeds the outstanding

19
00:01:33,369 --> 00:01:34,011
balance.

20
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:40,040
Teesra example: Kokar Health Point ka poora due cash mein.

21
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:44,014
Chemist list mein uska exact due likha hai.

22
00:01:44,014 --> 00:01:47,063
Wahi rakam daal kar Post receipt.

23
00:01:47,063 --> 00:01:49,004
Ab uska balance zero.

24
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:55,655
Neeche aaj ke collections ki list hai: receipt number, chemist, mode,

25
00:01:55,655 --> 00:02:01,687
reference aur kisne collect kiya, office, salesman ya delivery person.

26
00:02:01,687 --> 00:02:05,306
Shaam ko cash aur UPI isi list se milaiye.

27
00:02:05,973 --> 00:02:11,333
Cheques ka agla kadam: cheque bank mein jama hua, phir clear ya bounce.

28
00:02:11,333 --> 00:02:15,561
Bounce hone par chemist ka balance wapas badh jaata hai,

29
00:02:15,561 --> 00:02:19,865
aur credit risk score mein bounced cheque gina jaata hai.

30
00:02:20,527 --> 00:02:27,338
Ab Credit control par dekhiye: Doranda, Morabadi aur Kokar ke balance aur ageing turant

31
00:02:27,338 --> 00:02:28,512
update ho gaye.

32
00:02:28,512 --> 00:02:34,227
Collections ka asar dashboard ke Collected today card par bhi dikhta hai.

33
00:02:35,124 --> 00:02:41,451
Yaad rakhiye: har payment ka reference zaroor likhiye, cheque ki date sahi daaliye,

34
00:02:41,451 --> 00:02:45,872
aur roz shaam collection list ko bank aur cash se milaiye.

35
00:02:47,472 --> 00:02:54,380
Part 20 mein accounts: double-entry books, trial balance, day book, chemist ledger,

36
00:02:54,380 --> 00:03:02,204
supplier ledger, receipt aur payment vouchers, expenses, aur bank statement se reconciliation.

37
00:03:03,156 --> 00:03:06,599
Finance mein Accounts and bank kholiye.

38
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:13,927
Medoro mein alag se entry nahi karni padti: har invoice, credit note, receipt, GRN,

39
00:03:13,927 --> 00:03:19,048
payment aur claim apne-aap ek balanced voucher banata hai.

40
00:03:19,048 --> 00:03:21,608
Voucher kabhi edit nahi hote.

41
00:03:22,283 --> 00:03:28,522
Trial balance mein har account ka debit aur credit hai: bank, cash in hand,

42
00:03:28,522 --> 00:03:34,428
cheques in hand, input aur output GST, purchases, sales, sales returns,

43
00:03:34,428 --> 00:03:41,415
sundry debtors yaani chemists se lena, aur sundry creditors yaani suppliers ko dena.

44
00:03:41,415 --> 00:03:43,495
Neeche total barabar hai.

45
00:03:44,176 --> 00:03:50,522
Expenses bhi isi mein dikhte hain: rent, salaries, bijli aur delivery ka kharcha.

46
00:03:50,522 --> 00:03:53,342
Is demo mein yeh pehle se darj hain.

47
00:03:53,342 --> 00:03:58,826
Distribution ki screens mein abhi expense jodne ka alag form nahi hai,

48
00:03:58,826 --> 00:04:01,020
yeh QA report mein darj hai.

49
00:04:01,715 --> 00:04:09,738
Day book tab mein din ya mahine ke saare vouchers kram se: voucher number, type, narration,

50
00:04:09,738 --> 00:04:11,237
debit aur credit.

51
00:04:11,237 --> 00:04:16,086
Sales voucher, receipt, payment, journal, sab ek jagah.

52
00:04:16,086 --> 00:04:21,199
Isse cash book aur bank book ki jagah bhi kaam chalta hai.

53
00:04:21,926 --> 00:04:25,167
Chemist ka ledger uski profile mein hai.

54
00:04:25,167 --> 00:04:30,514
Jaise Doranda Drug House: opening balance, har invoice debit mein,

55
00:04:30,514 --> 00:04:35,457
har receipt aur credit note credit mein, aur running balance.

56
00:04:35,457 --> 00:04:39,346
Date range daal kar statement nikaal sakte hain.

57
00:04:40,021 --> 00:04:46,568
Supplier ka ledger supplier page par hai, jo Part 7 mein dekha: GRN credit mein,

58
00:04:46,568 --> 00:04:50,087
payments debit mein, aur We owe ka balance.

59
00:04:50,087 --> 00:04:55,161
Trial balance ka sundry creditors in sab suppliers ka jod hai.

60
00:04:55,904 --> 00:05:01,842
Bank reconciliation tab mein bank ka statement CSV ya Excel mein import kariye.

61
00:05:01,842 --> 00:05:07,930
Medoro har line ko books ki entry se milata hai: rakam, tareekh aur reference se.

62
00:05:07,930 --> 00:05:14,620
Jo nahi mila, woh Unmatched lines mein dikhta hai, aur use haath se match kar sakte hain.

63
00:05:15,322 --> 00:05:20,451
Automatic bank feed ya Account Aggregator abhi connected nahi hai.

64
00:05:20,451 --> 00:05:23,326
Statement file import hi tareeka hai.

65
00:05:23,326 --> 00:05:30,242
Profit and loss statement Distribution ki screen par abhi alag se nahi hai; trial balance

66
00:05:30,242 --> 00:05:35,526
ke sales, purchases aur kharche ke aankde CA ko diye jaa sakte hain.

67
00:05:36,202 --> 00:05:43,148
Accounts ka sabse bada faayda: bikri, kharid aur paisa, teeno ek hi system mein,

68
00:05:43,148 --> 00:05:46,013
isliye hisaab apne-aap milta hai.

69
00:05:46,013 --> 00:05:50,094
Mahine ke ant mein trial balance CA ko bhejiye.

70
00:05:51,687 --> 00:05:59,776
Part 21 mein GST reports: GSTR-1 aur GSTR-3B ki JSON file, HSN summary, CGST,

71
00:05:59,776 --> 00:06:07,025
SGST aur IGST, input tax credit, credit notes, aur CA ke liye export.

72
00:06:07,025 --> 00:06:13,643
Saath mein yeh bhi ki report aur asli filing mein kya fark hai.

73
00:06:14,609 --> 00:06:17,866
Finance mein GST returns kholiye.

74
00:06:17,866 --> 00:06:26,453
Upar likha hai: GSTR-1 aur GSTR-3B posted invoices, credit notes aur GRN se bante hain.

75
00:06:26,453 --> 00:06:33,757
JSON GSTN ke offline tool ke liye hai, aur filing GST portal par hoti hai.

76
00:06:34,421 --> 00:06:35,921
Mahina chuniye.

77
00:06:35,921 --> 00:06:44,818
Chaar aankde: kitne invoices, kitne B2B aur kitne cancelled; credit notes ke baad taxable

78
00:06:44,818 --> 00:06:50,017
value; output tax; aur GRN se mila input tax credit.

79
00:06:50,690 --> 00:06:59,506
HSN summary, yaani GSTR-1 ka Table 12: har HSN aur GST rate ke hisaab se quantity,

80
00:06:59,506 --> 00:07:04,451
taxable value, aur IGST, CGST, SGST alag-alag.

81
00:07:04,451 --> 00:07:12,622
Same-state bikri CGST aur SGST mein, aur Bihar ya Bengal ki bikri IGST mein.

82
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:22,536
GSTR-1 JSON button dabaate hi file download hoti hai, GSTN offline tool ke format mein.

83
00:07:22,536 --> 00:07:26,248
Isi tarah GSTR-3B JSON aur HSN CSV.

84
00:07:26,248 --> 00:07:30,490
In files ko CA ya accountant ko bhejiye.

85
00:07:31,179 --> 00:07:35,523
Credit notes bhi in reports mein apne-aap shamil hain,

86
00:07:35,523 --> 00:07:41,074
aur cancelled invoices GSTR-1 mein cancelled ke roop mein jaate hain.

87
00:07:41,074 --> 00:07:46,223
Purchase ki taraf GRN ka input tax credit GSTR-3B mein aata hai.

88
00:07:46,891 --> 00:07:51,812
Ek zaroori baat: Medoro report aur JSON taiyaar karta hai,

89
00:07:51,812 --> 00:07:55,546
par government portal par filing nahi karta.

90
00:07:55,546 --> 00:07:59,364
GSTN API se direct filing connected nahi hai.

91
00:07:59,364 --> 00:08:04,455
Filing se pehle aapke CA ko records zaroor jaanchne chahiye.

92
00:08:05,159 --> 00:08:10,674
E-invoice IRN aur e-way bill bhi abhi portal par hi banaye jaate hain.

93
00:08:10,674 --> 00:08:16,267
Settings mein Integrations ki list har cheez ka asli status batati hai.
